{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/d55e8878e82cdc59e4e63934afdc13a2.poster.avif?t=1769651402\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/d55e8878e82cdc59e4e63934afdc13a2.webm?t=1769651402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/d55e8878e82cdc59e4e63934afdc13a2.mp4?t=1769651402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a prisoner far from home, you must win your freedom in the Arena, slaying lizard-like creatures called Lacerites. Utilize the gifts of your bloodthirsty Patrons to gain the edge in combat as you tear through wave after wave to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/f89f98236a472fd22ac4b8b5b7827226.poster.avif?t=1769651402\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/f89f98236a472fd22ac4b8b5b7827226.webm?t=1769651402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/f89f98236a472fd22ac4b8b5b7827226.mp4?t=1769651402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SLASH, STAB, AND SEVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butcher hordes of Lacerites in gladiatorial combat with a variety of weapons from ancient Roman and Aztec cultures. Weaken enemies with your weapons to <i>break</i> them both in body and spirit. Dismember opponents limb by limb until you\u2019re the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/8ea503a6d0956c950295041f6d201cd0.poster.avif?t=1769651402\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/8ea503a6d0956c950295041f6d201cd0.webm?t=1769651402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/8ea503a6d0956c950295041f6d201cd0.mp4?t=1769651402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of weapons to smear Lacerites onto the arena floor. Sprout a tree from a spear, bash a skull with a super-sized macuahuitl, and wield the abilities of the gods with unique weapons specialized to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/59123e6b65317d3a78d20a5268d79922.avif?t=1769651402\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras_big/59123e6b65317d3a78d20a5268d79922.avif?t=1769651402 width=800 height=258 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Die Is Cast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397910/8d3e28becc7a467f0e85df48981f4523f3bbe1d9.jpg"},{"name":"That Scarlet Flame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397910/58d8645eea827c75f816a83b6b16b99857678020.jpg"},{"name":"Just A Flesh Wound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397910/568309f1755f12f822427b3905bde5ea15a525c2.jpg"},{"name":"Heads Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397910/55367ac69cf7e396d9b93391c3dea71411cdfc5f.jpg"},{"name":"Boomerang","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397910/b4de0a42c6f87cce5005872a188f99637df2c7ea.jpg"},{"name":"The End of All Things","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397910/8bac6c270afcb72415e74b29dff057f429da4b8e.jpg"},{"name":"Heavily Armed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397910/f5dd3c0364ae668c40df0ea5733d19b500909611.jpg"},{"name":"Loyal Customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397910/b8fc3a9b5c8d0a4bc934e989e2b794b8f6587d33.jpg"},{"name":"Ballin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397910/51468fc1c56116b28a798114da07fb5e65b0ad7b.jpg"},{"name":"Favor of the Patrons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397910/96953e48b9b6d016305da9060b3834f6af99b790.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2397910?t=1769651402","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2397910?t=1769651402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769651402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769651402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The moment to moment gameplay contains excessive violence with blood and dismemberment of non-human characters. There are also narrative themes of violence. Nothing depicted is especially realistic, as the game has cartoonish visuals, but the content may be upsetting to some."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\